    "reading": "The claim the paper may make is that on Static questions the retrieval gain is higher among automatically supported items than among unsupported ones, for the generators whose interaction interval excludes zero, and that the unsupported-subset gain is where the negative sign sits. It may not claim that unsupported evidence CAUSES the harm, nor that harm VANISHES under support."
